{"4800890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tombone: Legend of the Cave Babes", "steam_appid": 4800890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tombone is still in development - This is an early look!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tombone</strong> is a fast-paced action‑adventure game bursting with energy and character. Jump, dive, climb, and even sprint like a dog. Movement expands into the air with mid-flight boosts and jump chains. Combat is just as smooth and responsive leading into huge boss fights that test all your skills. The Repites are snatching babes all across the world, so team up with your best friend Tinka and take the fight to them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800890/extras/3ea80ca1d1f36e74b78147ea2ef9310d.poster.avif?t=1787766416\" width=1170 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800890/extras/3ea80ca1d1f36e74b78147ea2ef9310d.webm?t=1787766416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800890/extras/3ea80ca1d1f36e74b78147ea2ef9310d.mp4?t=1787766416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth, intuitive fast-paced movement &amp; action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge boss battles that challenge your abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple exotic worlds to explore: Wild Valley, Highfire Mountain, Starfall Ruins, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue kidnapped cave babes from the Reptites and take on optional challenges to save them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worlds full of collectibles to find that unlock new worlds and secrets with a 100% completion bonus.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800890/extras/b4463bd419482cce108e350260b5ee62.poster.avif?t=1787766416\" width=800 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800890/extras/b4463bd419482cce108e350260b5ee62.webm?t=1787766416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800890/extras/b4463bd419482cce108e350260b5ee62.mp4?t=1787766416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tombone is still in development - This is an early look!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tombone</strong> is a fast-paced action‑adventure game bursting with energy and character. Jump, dive, climb, and even sprint like a dog. Movement expands into the air with mid-flight boosts and jump chains. Combat is just as smooth and responsive leading into huge boss fights that test all your skills. The Repites are snatching babes all across the world, so team up with your best friend Tinka and take the fight to them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800890/extras/3ea80ca1d1f36e74b78147ea2ef9310d.poster.avif?t=1787766416\" width=1170 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800890/extras/3ea80ca1d1f36e74b78147ea2ef9310d.webm?t=1787766416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800890/extras/3ea80ca1d1f36e74b78147ea2ef9310d.mp4?t=1787766416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><s